  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Round table meeting on circular plastics in India</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The roundtable meeting on circular plastics in India aims to identify challenges and explore opportunities for Dutch companies with a presence in India, as well as those based in the Netherlands with potential interest in the Indian plastic waste sector. Knowledge institutes and non-governmental organisations (NGOs) will also participate to share insights and expertise. The expected result is a clear recommendation on whether to continue working on circular plastics under the Track Waste Management India in 2026.</narrative>
  </description>
